{"url": "https://www.uah.edu/eng/departments/cme/programs/graduate", "final_url": "https://www.uah.edu/eng/departments/cme/programs/graduate", "status": 200, "method": "http", "fetched": "2026-10-29", "text": "UAH | Engineering | Departments | Chemical & Materials | Programs | Graduate | The University of Alabama in Huntsville\nSkip to main content\nI am a...\nProspective Student\nCurrent Student\nParent\nResearch Partner\nFaculty / Staff Member\nAlumni\nVisit UAH\nApply to UAH\nRequest Info\nCampus Map\n\u00d7\nVisit UAH\nApply to UAH\nRequest Info\nCampus Map\nHome\nAdmission & Aid\nAcademics\nResearch\nLife at UAH\nGiving\nAthletics\nNews\nEngineering\nDepartments\nChemical & Materials\nPrograms\nGraduate\nGraduate\nChemical and Materials\nAbout CME\nMessage from the Chair\nMission Statement\nNewsletter\nPrograms\nUndergraduate\nGraduate\nJUMP\nFaculty & Staff\nResearch\nStudent Organizations\nABET Information\nNews\nContact Us\nThe graduate program of the Chemical and Materials Engineering at the University of Alabama in Huntsville seeks to provide cutting-edge training in chemical engineering research areas including biotechnology, catalysis, electrochemistry, energy and the environment, polymers, and separations. Students experience close interaction with faculty members, work in excellent research facilities, and participate in multidisciplinary research centers.\nMSE in Chemical Engineering MS in Materials Science Ph.D in Materials Science\nCHE in Biotechnology Ph.D in Mechanical Engineering\nGraduate Certificate Programs (pending approval)\nChemical Engineering\nMaterials\nBiotechnology\nEntrepreneurship\nCurrent and Prospective Students\nCourse Descriptions\nResearch Area in CME\nProspective graduate students apply to the chemical engineering graduate program online through the University of Alabama in Huntsville. Applications are evaluated using an established process that considers a variety of factors including academic background and record, GRE scores, and references.\nRequest More Information\nAPPLY TODAY!\nHave questions? Contact your coordinator!\nYu Lei\nCME Graduate Program Coordinator\nEngineering Building Room 117\n256.824.6527\nyu.lei@uah.edu\nResources\nAbout UAH\nAcademics\nAccessibility\nAdmissions\nAlumni\nCalendars\nCampus Map\nCampus Police\nCareers\nContinuing Education\nDirectory\nEvents\nFinancial Aid\nGiving\nLibrary\nMyUAH\nNews\nPrivacy\nStudent Life\nVisit Campus\nContact Us\nThe University of Alabama in Huntsville\n301 Sparkman Drive\nHuntsville, AL 35899\nContact UAH\n256.824.1000\n\u00a92026 The University of Alabama in Huntsville\nWe use cookies to ensure that we give you the best experience on our website. Please review our Online Privacy Statement for more information.\nI Understand\nClose Menu\nHome\nAdmission & Aid\nAcademics\nResearch\nLife at UAH\nGiving\nAthletics\nNews\nI AM A...\nCurrent Student\nParent\nResearch Partner\nFaculty / Staff Member\nAlumni\nCampus Map", "links": [["Skip to main content", "https://www.uah.edu/eng/departments/cme/programs/graduate#mainContent"], ["I am a...", "javascript:"], ["Prospective Student", "https://www.uah.edu/admissions/undergraduate/apply-for-admission"], ["Current Student", "https://www.uah.edu/students"], ["Parent", "https://www.uah.edu/parents"], ["Research Partner", "https://www.uah.edu/research-partners"], ["Faculty / Staff Member", "https://www.uah.edu/faculty-staff"], ["Alumni", "https://www.uah.edu/alumni"], ["Visit UAH", "https://www.uah.edu/admissions/undergraduate/discover-uah/visit-campus"], ["Apply to UAH", "https://www.uah.edu/admissions"], ["Request Info", "https://www.uah.edu/request-info"], ["Campus Map", "https://www.uah.edu/map"], ["\u00d7", "javascript:void(0)"], ["", "https://www.uah.edu/"], ["", "https://www.uah.edu/"], ["Visit UAH", "https://www.uah.edu/admissions/undergraduate/discover-uah/visit-campus"], ["Apply to UAH", "https://www.uah.edu/admissions"], ["Request Info", "https://www.uah.edu/request-info"], ["Campu